WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:35.820
Ohhhhhhh!

3
00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:39.790
Watch where you're stepping!

4
00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:40.920
You could've killed us!

5
00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:41.620
Oops!

6
00:01:42.230 --> 00:01:43.030
Sorry!

7
00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:48.570
Look at you!

8
00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:51.490
Bonney's not the only one
who's hit a growth spurt.

9
00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:54.750
You won't lay a finger
on Old Man Apple!

10
00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:57.350
Listen kids, some
of us have jobs.

11
00:01:57.940 --> 00:02:01.060
Let me go back
to doing mine, please.

12
00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:03.190
Let you go.

13
00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:04.000
Okay!

14
00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.650
Ha ha ha ha ha ha!

15
00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:10.460
Ha!

16
00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:12.790
Ohhhhhhh!

17
00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:24.810
Light it!

18
00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:39.070
Whoa, take it easy!

19
00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:41.220
Tch!

20
00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:45.760
Tch!

21
00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:56.200
<b>Luffy vs. Kizaru</b>

22
00:02:58.110 --> 00:02:59.310
We have to run now!

23
00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:00.120
Let's hurry!

24
00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.280
Yeah, you're right!

25
00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.830
Let's go while Luffy
keeps Kizaru busy!

26
00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:11.960
Okay, but we have to be
gentle with Robin. Hey, Atlas!

27
00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:14.750
I have to take control
of the pacifistas!

28
00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:15.710
Otherwise...

29
00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:17.920
as soon as the barrier
falls down...

30
00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:24.550
Their lasers will blow
us to smithereens!

31
00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:26.520
That's good thinking!

32
00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:30.310
Us Vegapunks are the highest
authority on the island after all!

33
00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:32.800
And whoever controls
the pacifistas wins!

34
00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:34.640
Hell yeah!

35
00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:35.650
We've got this!

36
00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.010
Atlas, wait!

37
00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.340
That is I mean to say...

38
00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:41.120
Please!

39
00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:42.890
Take me with you!

40
00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:43.770
What?

41
00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:46.220
You cannot go!

42
00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:47.150
Why not?

43
00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:48.350
Are you kidding me?

44
00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:51.610
There are 30,000 marines out
there who all want you dead!

45
00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:53.760
I know, but...

46
00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:55.080
Come in, Franky!

47
00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:56.050
This is Vegapunk!

48
00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:56.930
Can you hear me?

49
00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:57.680
What's up?

50
00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:59.880
I just saw Bonney
down in the city!

51
00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:01.070
She's alive then?

52
00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:02.200
What a relief!

53
00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:03.450
She hit the barrier!

54
00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:05.120
Kizaru's the one who
kicked her hard!

55
00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:06.710
He did what to her!

56
00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:08.390
And you just stood
there and watched!

57
00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:10.320
You're a grown man!

58
00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:11.920
I'm sorry, okay?

59
00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.650
I'll go save her right now!

60
00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:14.820
You'd better!

61
00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:17.430
But what are we gonna
do about the barrier?

62
00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:20.190
I've made up my mind!

63
00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:20.890
I'm going!

64
00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:21.580
What?

65
00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:24.110
They'll have Edison
deactivate the barrier!

66
00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:29.150
Hey, it's Sanji!

67
00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:30.960
<b>Second Floor
Building A</b>

68
00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:31.550
I heard what you said.

69
00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:32.570
All of it.

70
00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:38.000
You're gonna go
in and rescue her, right?

71
00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:39.930
Then you can count me in!

72
00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:41.320
Our work here is done.

73
00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:45.170
We picked up the luggage you
asked us to and we're on our way.

74
00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:47.520
I'll head toward the rear
exit immediately.

75
00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.010
Let's all meet up there.

76
00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:51.230
<b>Below
In the Fabriophase</b>

77
00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:53.030
Reporting in!

78
00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:56.090
We've all been turned into
children or old people!

79
00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:57.780
What?

80
00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:00.070
Everyone, avoid
the center of town!

81
00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.210
It's a trap!

82
00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:04.400
All central units were
ambushed by Jewelry Bonney!

83
00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:06.880
Search the surrounding
zones cautiously!

84
00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:08.580
She has the power
to change your age!

85
00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:14.350
She can't have gotten far!

86
00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:17.190
Find Jewelry Bonney
and take her down!

87
00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:20.310
Damn it!

88
00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:21.170
Hey!

89
00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:22.270
Over here!

90
00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:24.640
I found Sentomaru!

91
00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:26.520
But he...

92
00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.210
It looks like he's been burned.

93
00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:31.200
But he...

94
00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:31.940
Sentomaru...

95
00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:46.090
Sentomaru?

96
00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:48.100
Run away...

97
00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:49.630
Bonney...

98
00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.420
The Marines...

99
00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:53.470
Are coming...

100
00:05:59.140 --> 00:05:59.940
Sentomaru!

101
00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:03.490
What should I do?

102
00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:04.460
Have you found her?

103
00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:05.290
Not yet, sir!

104
00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:06.140
Check that way!

105
00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:06.920
Yes, sir!

106
00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:09.580
We need to find her!

107
00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:12.060
I wonder if I can hide
until this is all over.

108
00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:14.980
<b>Labophase</b>

109
00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.070
We need to find her!

110
00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:17.530
Whoa!

111
00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.900
Was that pigeon guy?

112
00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:21.020
Zoro!

113
00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:22.360
Do you want my help?

114
00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:27.220
Just focus on Kizaru!

115
00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:28.700
He's the real problem!

116
00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:31.070
Ha!

117
00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:47.030
Ha, you're barely keeping up.

118
00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:51.920
If this is the best you can do, you're
never gonna get another shot at our captain.

119
00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:55.600
Ha ha ha,
but I've still got you.

120
00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:57.730
An Emperor's first mate.

121
00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:00.230
That's a worthy trophy.

122
00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:18.570
When I might drown,
that won't do at all.

123
00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:30.120
Yasakani Sacred Jewel!

124
00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:37.190
Ow!

125
00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:44.220
Hey!

126
00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:46.020
That's right!

127
00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:13.550
Ow!

128
00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:19.940
My face!

129
00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:37.010
I see! These are holograms!

130
00:08:37.090 --> 00:08:38.860
I don't know which one's real!

131
00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:41.870
Gah!

132
00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:48.830
Just kidding!

133
00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:50.870
I'll hit them all!

134
00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:52.280
Gum-Gum...!

135
00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:53.820
Dawn...!

136
00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:26.060
Now this is unfortunate.

137
00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:29.790
I leave for one second
and Vegapunk is gone.

138
00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:32.500
Could you tell me
where he is, please?

139
00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:36.100
There ain't nothing I can do,
so I'll help right there.

140
00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:38.340
Huh?

141
00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:51.690
Wait!

142
00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:53.100
Hey, Vegapunk!

143
00:09:53.180 --> 00:09:54.300
Let me in there!

144
00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:57.140
You're really worked up!

145
00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:58.670
Not that I blame you, though.

146
00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:01.770
Don't you touch her, you
bootlicking Navy scum!

147
00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:03.030
Never fear, Bonney!

148
00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:03.940
I'm on my way!

149
00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:05.180
Stay strong!

150
00:10:05.260 --> 00:10:08.420
I should have protected you,
you poor darling child!

151
00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:10.280
Poor darling child?

152
00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:11.210
Get in already!

153
00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:13.610
I'll let you in the bubble!

154
00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:15.880
Just shove yourself through!

155
00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:17.490
Well, if you say so.

156
00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:18.590
Huh?

157
00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:19.500
Gah!

158
00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:20.730
Huh?

159
00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:27.170
What are you doing?

160
00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.420
Stay in the dome thing!

161
00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:30.660
You're gonna get
killed out here!

162
00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.190
Did you think I'd
just let you run?

163
00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:40.480
This is over, old man.

164
00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:04.370
Back already?

165
00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:05.390
Whoa!

166
00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:07.020
Stella!

167
00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:09.000
Change of plans!

168
00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:11.670
We'll use General Franky
to carry the Sunny!

169
00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:14.250
I'm catching a ride
with these bros!

170
00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:15.160
Okay!

171
00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:17.340
Hm?

172
00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:25.220
Oh...

173
00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:30.700
Oh...

174
00:11:43.740 --> 00:11:44.540
Do it!

175
00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:46.120
Right away!

176
00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:47.780
Frontier Dome!

177
00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:49.920
Partially deactivate!

178
00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:53.400
Reactivate!

179
00:11:57.300 --> 00:11:59.320
Can this thing fly?!

180
00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:11.560
Wait, what's that?

181
00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:13.990
Something's up there.

182
00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:16.750
Hold on, I think
I can see inside.

183
00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:18.630
It's Doctor Vegapunk!

184
00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:23.430
<b>Off the Coast of Egghead</b>

185
00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:23.120
I have a report from
the Fabriophase!

186
00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:24.600
It's urgent!

187
00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:26.600
We've just spotted Vegapunk!

188
00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:29.080
He's descending from
the Labophase in a vehicle!

189
00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:29.960
Take aim!

190
00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:30.940
Prepare to fire!

191
00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:41.830
Pacifistas!

192
00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:44.160
You have a new order!

193
00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:46.400
Direct from Dr. Vegapunk!

194
00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:48.320
Every marine on the island!

195
00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:25.310
I think it's aiming at us!

196
00:13:26.690 --> 00:13:28.580
New target designated.

197
00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.510
Eliminate all marines
on Egghead.

198
00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:32.420
Hmm.

199
00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:50.080
They have a new order.

200
00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:52.690
Dr. Vegapunk must have
taken control back.

201
00:13:58.010 --> 00:13:59.500
So many pacifistas!

202
00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:01.820
How are we supposed
to fight them all?

203
00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:04.960
Damn you, Vegapunk!

204
00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:06.730
Yeah!

205
00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.620
Now it's a party!

206
00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:11.400
Let's rip, pacifistas!

207
00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:15.930
Seems they're all responding
to the command.

208
00:14:16.010 --> 00:14:16.840
Yeah!

209
00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.220
Hold up!

210
00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:23.300
It looks like we're
going straight down!

211
00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:25.950
We're not going to dive bomb
into the ground, are we?

212
00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:27.510
We are on island clouds.

213
00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:30.180
It's in their nature
to attach to one another.

214
00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:34.670
Since our tires are also made of clouds,
we won't fall to our deaths even if we head

215
00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:35.450
straight down.

216
00:14:36.030 --> 00:14:37.680
But enough about our ride.

217
00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:39.340
We must find Bonney!

218
00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:41.960
She's surely alone
and terrified down there!

219
00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:42.660
Hey Bonney!

220
00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:45.790
Bonney!

221
00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:47.270
Hey Bonney!

222
00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:49.620
Bonney!

223
00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.080
I need to focus.

224
00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:01.340
Don't think.

225
00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:02.220
Feel.

226
00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:08.310
I'll reach out across the entire universe
and sense her with the waves of my soul.

227
00:15:19.090 --> 00:15:20.760
My lady-dar got a ping!

228
00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:21.900
I found her!

229
00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:23.410
Where is she?

230
00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:26.330
All I can see are marines
everywhere I look!

231
00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:27.050
Same for me!

232
00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:28.140
Are you sure?

233
00:15:28.220 --> 00:15:29.190
Don't question me!

234
00:15:29.270 --> 00:15:31.390
My lady-dar has never
been wrong once!

235
00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:32.170
Oh yeah?

236
00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:37.770
I dispute the science of your methods,
but I will trust your instinct!

237
00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:38.750
Thanks, Doctor!

238
00:15:39.670 --> 00:15:44.740
Now if you'll all excuse me, this tank just
can't keep up with my impatient heart!

239
00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:48.160
Don't worry, Bonney!

240
00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:49.920
I'm on my way!

241
00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:53.800
What a relief.

242
00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:57.240
Looks like the pacifistas
are back on our side.

243
00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:09.930
Thought you could hide, huh?

244
00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:13.240
This is over, Jewelry Bonney!

245
00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:15.620
<b>Vice Admiral Pomsky
Marine Headquarters</b>

246
00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:15.610
You'll pay for what
you did to our men!

247
00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:17.460
Over there!

248
00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:18.260
Go!

249
00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:27.140
Over there!

250
00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:28.650
Go!

251
00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:41.750
Ahhhhh!

252
00:16:56.730 --> 00:16:58.570
What the hell is wrong
with you three?!

253
00:16:58.570 --> 00:16:59.390
I just think I have
a heart attack.

254
00:16:59.390 --> 00:16:59.910
I think I just...

255
00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:00.740
I don't know.

256
00:17:02.510 --> 00:17:04.030
Get back here!

257
00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:05.400
I'm not done with you!

258
00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:10.910
You cannot escape!

259
00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:12.580
Huh?

260
00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:14.460
Huh?

261
00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:16.240
Why?

262
00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:17.830
Ha!

263
00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:23.090
I can't command all the pacifistas,
but I snuck around the rules for this one!

264
00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:28.760
I have the power to control anything I sit
on, cause I'm a driving human who eats the

265
00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:29.860
<b>Vice Admiral Bluegrass
Marine Headquarters</b>

266
00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:29.980
Ride-Ride fruit!

267
00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:31.730
Now here's a little question.

268
00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:35.400
Will the curse you placed
on our men be lifted if I kill you?

269
00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:41.990
Dad...

270
00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:44.210
Last chance, kiddo!

271
00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:47.010
Change them back now!

272
00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:50.980
Huh?

273
00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:57.260
Come on, Bonney.

274
00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:58.850
Don't zone out on us now.

275
00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:01.880
Blackleg?

276
00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:04.150
Look, I get it.

277
00:18:04.230 --> 00:18:06.520
It's because Kuma's
your father, right?

278
00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:12.290
You have to remember
they're not him.

279
00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:13.250
If you can't...

280
00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:16.700
Otter Hammer!

281
00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:22.390
Marines everywhere.

282
00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:26.520
Time for us to go.

283
00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:28.500
Go pacifista!

284
00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:29.280
Fire!

285
00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:32.780
A spear!

286
00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:34.390
Huh?

287
00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:41.370
Slippers?

288
00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:45.690
I'll let you know!

289
00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:51.220
Let's go!

290
00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:51.780
Oh!

291
00:18:51.780 --> 00:18:52.480
Look!

292
00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:52.580
Here's the machine!

293
00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:54.050
Wait, you have to get it! I'll do it!

294
00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:11.300
<b>Labophase</b>

295
00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:09.470
Huh?

296
00:19:10.860 --> 00:19:11.690
Hmm?

297
00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:31.770
Look, I don't know why you're doing
this, but I've got orders to follow.

298
00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:35.570
I don't care!

299
00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:50.830
If you'll excuse me, I have a mission to wrap
up and you are wasting too much of my time!

300
00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:57.600
That's the idea!

301
00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:02.120
It's my mission
to get in your way!

302
00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:07.760
What to do...

303
00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:12.440
Come back!

304
00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:27.120
Why did you stop?

305
00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:27.980
What's wrong?

306
00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:29.290
It's weird.

307
00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.840
Something doesn't feel right.

308
00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:33.190
What is this?

309
00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:35.230
Such an unnatural presence.

310
00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:54.650
I can't believe
what I'm seeing.

311
00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:59.070
All units, stand down.

312
00:21:06.520 --> 00:21:06.840
Look!

313
00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:10.640
The pacifistas aren't
protecting us anymore!

314
00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:12.280
They're not even moving!

315
00:21:12.360 --> 00:21:12.760
Come on!

316
00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:13.940
I gave you an order!

317
00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:17.880
You're supposed
to keep us safe!

318
00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:21.170
Something's happening!

319
00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:26.790
There's only one group above
Vegapunk on the authority ladder.

320
00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:27.900
And that's...

321
00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:30.660
The Five Elders!

322
00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:48.140
It's a pentagram!

323
00:21:58.650 --> 00:22:00.410
What the hell?

324
00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:01.720
Step on it!

325
00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:02.960
Get to high ground!

326
00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:04.090
I'll try!

327
00:22:07.770 --> 00:22:09.660
Attention all marines!

328
00:22:09.740 --> 00:22:11.990
Saint Saturn is on his way!

329
00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:14.380
He will arrive
on Egghead shortly!

330
00:22:15.330 --> 00:22:20.930
Not a single marine below the rank
of Commodore may be in his presence!

331
00:22:21.010 --> 00:22:22.050
He's coming here?

332
00:22:22.130 --> 00:22:22.900
I repeat!

333
00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:27.540
Saint Saturn of the Five Elders
will make landfall on Egghead!

334
00:22:36.110 --> 00:22:38.880
What was that explosion?

335
00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:40.470
One of the Five Elders.

336
00:22:40.550 --> 00:22:42.610
So I'm shocked that
they came in person.

337
00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:43.930
The Five Elders?

338
00:22:44.010 --> 00:22:44.980
Never heard of them.

339
00:22:44.980 --> 00:22:45.890
Who are they?

340
00:22:45.970 --> 00:22:48.320
The highest authorities
in the world!

341
00:22:48.320 --> 00:22:49.280
Wait, for real?

342
00:23:10.050 --> 00:23:13.530
Something big's coming out!

343
00:23:39.550 --> 00:23:40.880
What the hell is that?

344
00:23:41.290 --> 00:23:42.600
It's some kind of monster!

345
00:23:42.680 --> 00:23:43.470
Cut it out!

346
00:23:43.950 --> 00:23:45.230
That must be...

347
00:23:45.310 --> 00:23:46.520
Go away!

348
00:23:54.910 --> 00:23:56.270
The surface.

349
00:23:57.300 --> 00:23:59.720
It's been quite a while.

350
00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:04.260
<b>St. Jaygarcia Saturn
Godhead of Science and Defense
Five Elders, Highest Authority of the World Government</b>

351
00:24:02.340 --> 00:24:04.840
It's huge!

352
00:24:05.550 --> 00:24:06.500
What is that thing?

353
00:24:06.560 --> 00:24:07.360
Above us!

354
00:24:09.120 --> 00:24:09.950
Dodge!

355
00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:15.190
Oops.

356
00:24:16.650 --> 00:24:18.210
That was a close one.

357
00:24:18.700 --> 00:24:20.730
We don't have any
clouds to grasp!

358
00:24:23.840 --> 00:24:24.640
Kizaru!

359
00:24:32.490 --> 00:24:35.250
Boy, you gotta be
running out of juice.

360
00:24:35.330 --> 00:24:37.050
That form won't hold up.

361
00:24:37.130 --> 00:24:38.310
Do something, Luffy!

362
00:24:38.840 --> 00:24:40.400
We're literally gonna die!

363
00:24:49.120 --> 00:24:50.450
I got you!

364
00:24:57.070 --> 00:24:58.630
Oh god!

365
00:25:04.040 --> 00:25:04.870
Stop!

366
00:25:07.470 --> 00:25:10.450
Ahem.

367
00:25:19.370 --> 00:25:20.170
Nope.

368
00:25:21.500 --> 00:25:22.980
I don't like that.

369
00:25:55.550 --> 00:25:56.840
You okay, Doc?

370
00:25:56.920 --> 00:25:58.170
Still breathing?

371
00:25:58.170 --> 00:25:59.850
So it would seem.

372
00:25:59.930 --> 00:26:00.970
Atlas, are you hurt?

373
00:26:01.370 --> 00:26:01.850
I'm okay.

374
00:26:01.850 --> 00:26:02.900
Are you Saint Saturn?

375
00:26:11.470 --> 00:26:12.250
I am.

376
00:26:15.260 --> 00:26:18.700
I thought you were
already dead, Vegapunk.

377
00:26:19.680 --> 00:26:20.940
What a shame.

378
00:26:27.490 --> 00:26:30.560
I gave you an order,
Vegapunk.

379
00:26:40.270 --> 00:26:40.860
Bonney, wait!

380
00:26:40.860 --> 00:26:41.690
Please!

381
00:26:46.990 --> 00:26:50.080
You must eliminate
Kuma's free will.

382
00:26:51.570 --> 00:26:53.190
But if I do that to him...

383
00:26:54.580 --> 00:26:55.400
I'll kill you!
